---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/institution.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="About | Pacific Edge" description="Why Pacific Edge exists and how we work.">
  <div class="institution-page about-page">
  <section class="institution-intro shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>We work across disciplines because difficult problems rarely respect organizational boundaries.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Pacific Edge is a strategy, transformation and applied innovation practice based on the Pacific coast of Canada.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="institution-section">
    <div class="shell institution-copy">
      <h2>Why we exist</h2>
      <div>
        <p>Organizations are increasingly asked to make consequential decisions in environments where strategy, operations, technology, information and people are tightly connected.</p>
        <p>Pacific Edge exists to help make those situations intelligible and turn understanding into useful action.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="institution-section institution-dark" aria-labelledby="practice-title">
    <div class="shell">
      <p class="eyebrow">How we work</p><h2 id="practice-title">Understanding and making<br />belong together.</h2>
      <div class="practice-pair"><article><span>01 / Advisory</span><h3>Make the situation intelligible.</h3><p>Advisory works with organizations on complex decisions, operating systems and transformation.</p><a href="/capabilities">Explore our capabilities ↗</a></article><article><span>02 / Labs</span><h3>Build what the problem needs.</h3><p>Labs investigates, prototypes and builds when the problem calls for something that does not exist yet.</p><a href="/labs">Explore Labs ↗</a></article></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="institution-section"><div class="shell institution-copy"><h2>What are you<br />working on?</h2><div><p>If you're dealing with something complicated, consequential, or difficult to fit neatly into a box, we'd be interested to hear about it.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact">Start a conversation →</a></div></div></section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
